WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world, we hold balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Dare to part the primal cosmos♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.460 --> 01:42.340
[Episode 29]

01:43.470 --> 01:44.890
Do you remember

01:46.360 --> 01:48.450
sitting by our pond?

01:48.470 --> 01:50.420
We caught a little fish

01:50.440 --> 01:52.420
and made a big pot of fish soup.

01:54.000 --> 01:55.450
Do you ever recall

01:56.030 --> 01:57.810
those few missing sheep

01:57.830 --> 02:00.650
that ate flowers but no grass?

02:01.550 --> 02:02.580
And also,

02:03.000 --> 02:04.650
your Junior Ling'e,

02:04.670 --> 02:06.340
who didn't eat much

02:06.360 --> 02:08.650
but was always chubby and mischievous?

02:16.270 --> 02:17.180
Changshou,

02:19.830 --> 02:20.780
all these years,

02:22.040 --> 02:23.740
so much has happened over the years,

02:26.550 --> 02:28.410
and so many people have
been by your side.

02:32.830 --> 02:35.060
You were never alone.

02:56.780 --> 02:58.300
[Scripture of Steadiness]

02:59.670 --> 03:00.570
The Scripture of Steadiness?

03:03.080 --> 03:04.850
Senior, I've copied 500 times.

03:04.870 --> 03:05.940
Please check it.

03:07.080 --> 03:07.850
Junior.

03:08.550 --> 03:09.570
The Demon Emperor has returned.

03:09.590 --> 03:10.620
You should have run.

03:10.640 --> 03:11.650
Instead, you rushed in.

03:11.870 --> 03:13.460
Senior, you're not playing it safe.

03:13.870 --> 03:15.370
Punish yourself with 500 copies.

03:18.430 --> 03:19.250
Where are you going?

03:24.710 --> 03:25.500
Actually,

03:26.430 --> 03:27.650
coming to Jade Division,

03:28.670 --> 03:29.780
meeting you,

03:30.080 --> 03:31.250
Mentor,

03:31.590 --> 03:32.620
and everyone...

03:33.800 --> 03:34.850
I'm really happy.

03:35.670 --> 03:37.650
Thought I had no family anymore,

03:38.480 --> 03:39.410
but now,

03:40.550 --> 03:42.060
I will fight for my family.

03:47.990 --> 03:48.780
Senior.

03:50.240 --> 03:51.020
I'm sorry.

03:51.670 --> 03:53.620
I may never copy scriptures again.

03:59.990 --> 04:00.850
Junior.

04:16.790 --> 04:17.420
Changshou.

04:18.030 --> 04:18.940
Your foundation is too weak.

04:19.320 --> 04:20.660
You'd better stay out of this.

04:20.880 --> 04:22.060
Senior Changshou, go.

04:22.080 --> 04:23.180
We'll hold off the Demon Emperor.

04:23.200 --> 04:24.010
Don't go. You'll die.

04:24.030 --> 04:24.660
So what?

04:25.030 --> 04:26.210
Mentor already died in battle.

04:26.710 --> 04:28.100
The other disciples are dead too.

04:28.910 --> 04:30.420
You've always looked after me, Senior.

04:30.830 --> 04:32.620
This time, I'll fight for you.

04:47.640 --> 04:48.620
So it was you.

04:51.350 --> 04:52.180
Your Highness.

04:52.590 --> 04:53.370
Thank you.

04:54.000 --> 04:55.420
You helped me come this far.

04:56.590 --> 04:58.570
Today, we may live or die.

04:58.680 --> 04:59.980
If we both survive,

05:01.200 --> 05:02.450
will you take me as your disciple?

05:04.680 --> 05:05.450
I...

05:06.080 --> 05:07.010
I understand.

05:07.390 --> 05:09.370
A war is upon us. Stay focused.

05:10.200 --> 05:10.860
Let's talk later.

05:30.470 --> 05:31.770
I'm back again.

05:34.350 --> 05:36.660
Why shoulder everything?

05:37.000 --> 05:38.740
No matter how huge it is?

05:38.880 --> 05:39.890
And somehow,

05:39.910 --> 05:41.420
you've got all these people

05:41.440 --> 05:42.620
following you into this mess.

05:42.640 --> 05:44.060
Your foundation is damaged, old man.

05:44.080 --> 05:45.620
What are you even doing here?

05:45.640 --> 05:46.620
What am I doing?

05:46.640 --> 05:47.740
I want to go back too.

05:47.760 --> 05:49.010
But I cannot.

05:49.200 --> 05:51.180
Water Dragon Spouts lined up in queue.

05:51.680 --> 05:53.180
But this place is way too dangerous.

05:53.200 --> 05:53.940
Dangerous?

05:54.230 --> 05:56.420
I'm not the coward you think I am.

05:56.880 --> 05:58.450
I just wanna stay and see.

05:58.470 --> 05:59.250
See that?

06:04.880 --> 06:07.660
I've always had a feeling

06:08.590 --> 06:09.980
that my disciple was meant

06:10.760 --> 06:13.370
for great things.

06:14.440 --> 06:15.250
Clearly,

06:15.790 --> 06:18.620
you can set up formations like that,

06:19.390 --> 06:20.180
and

06:21.030 --> 06:23.450
your Evasion Art is formidable.

06:23.880 --> 06:26.740
Yet you hide in Jade Division.

06:29.470 --> 06:30.620
Mentor, I actually...

06:30.790 --> 06:32.060
Do not say it.

06:32.680 --> 06:34.660
I'm afraid I couldn't handle it.

06:36.590 --> 06:37.370
Changshou.

06:39.560 --> 06:40.660
I haven't done much

06:41.470 --> 06:42.860
with my life.

06:43.390 --> 06:44.180
But,

06:45.590 --> 06:46.770
meeting you,

06:48.270 --> 06:49.540
taking you in,

06:50.470 --> 06:51.810
teaching you...

06:53.270 --> 06:55.010
I think I did pretty well.

06:56.760 --> 06:57.540
Changshou.

06:59.030 --> 07:00.420
Remember this.

07:03.030 --> 07:03.980
From now on,

07:04.880 --> 07:07.210
do whatever you need to do.

07:07.880 --> 07:11.660
Just remember one thing.

07:12.030 --> 07:12.860
Tell me, Mentor.

07:13.790 --> 07:16.210
Go raise some hell!

07:16.390 --> 07:19.210
Turn the whole world upside down.

07:19.230 --> 07:21.570
Show them what Jade Division's made of.

07:31.680 --> 07:32.620
Yes, Mentor.

07:35.570 --> 07:37.760
♪I know the world's full of deceit♪

07:37.760 --> 07:38.940
Turn the world upside down!

07:40.230 --> 07:41.690
Fight through hell and back!

07:42.640 --> 07:44.180
Make heaven and hell tremble!

07:44.680 --> 07:46.210
Give 'em something to fear!

07:46.560 --> 07:47.690
We'll shake the skies!

07:47.710 --> 07:49.300
We're unstoppable!

07:51.590 --> 07:53.210
Maybe I got

07:53.230 --> 07:54.450
a little carried away there.

07:56.440 --> 07:57.210
Changshou.

07:58.030 --> 08:00.570
Maybe I talked a little too big.

08:00.590 --> 08:02.860
Could you raise just a little less hell?

08:03.150 --> 08:03.940
Wait, Chang...

08:06.030 --> 08:07.660
Why show me all this?

08:10.080 --> 08:11.370
Don't you get it yet?

08:11.390 --> 08:13.370
I already found a way out.

08:14.440 --> 08:15.420
You found it?

08:15.420 --> 08:17.270
♪Who's clamoring behind♪

08:18.080 --> 08:20.770
Heaven derives forty-nine paths,
yet one escapes.

08:21.080 --> 08:22.330
All karma

08:22.470 --> 08:24.770
had its answer from the start.

08:25.030 --> 08:26.130
I was too foolish

08:26.440 --> 08:28.210
to see this until now.

08:29.080 --> 08:30.250
Thank you, Jin Chan.

08:31.230 --> 08:32.060
Were it not for you

08:32.590 --> 08:34.060
giving me these 3,600 years,

08:34.200 --> 08:36.570
I'd never find enlightenment.

08:38.040 --> 08:40.040
♪Battling fierce demons♪

08:40.040 --> 08:41.450
But what you showed me

08:42.160 --> 08:43.730
all pointed to failure.

08:44.590 --> 08:45.810
Of course you couldn't see it.

08:46.590 --> 08:48.210
Because this is Fate's game.

08:48.210 --> 08:50.080
♪Rising with golden armor♪

08:50.080 --> 08:51.970
Everyone around you is karma.

08:52.630 --> 08:54.260
Only by remembering them all

08:54.470 --> 08:56.060
can you find the way out.

08:56.680 --> 08:57.450
But you

08:58.870 --> 09:00.450
forgot them all long ago.

09:02.400 --> 09:03.300
Impossible.

09:04.560 --> 09:05.850
I've lived through four lives

09:06.350 --> 09:07.380
for over thirty thousand years.

09:07.440 --> 09:08.970
Even I never grasped it.

09:08.990 --> 09:09.970
How could you...

09:10.040 --> 09:11.180
Shut up, you fool.

09:11.680 --> 09:13.660
You're nothing but Fate's castoff.

09:13.990 --> 09:15.940
Quit trying to make yourself relevant.

09:17.630 --> 09:18.450
Let me tell you something.

09:18.800 --> 09:19.810
From the very beginning,

09:20.280 --> 09:23.020
Fate never once cared about you.

09:25.080 --> 09:26.420
Now, I'll show you

09:26.870 --> 09:28.730
what it means to be the Chosen One.

09:32.160 --> 09:32.940
Fate.

09:33.960 --> 09:36.450
I've seen through your secrets.
I know everything now.

09:36.560 --> 09:38.260
If you want them to stay secret,

09:38.990 --> 09:40.060
come face me!

09:44.400 --> 09:45.180
Impossible.

09:45.800 --> 09:46.730
Impossible!

09:48.040 --> 09:48.810
Impossible.

09:49.870 --> 09:50.660
Impossible.

09:51.080 --> 09:51.850
Jin Chan,

09:52.040 --> 09:53.060
if in the next life,

09:53.200 --> 09:54.420
you and I meet again,

09:55.040 --> 09:56.730
I'll surely kill you with my own hands.

09:59.160 --> 09:59.940
Take me.

10:00.280 --> 10:01.020
Take me.

10:01.040 --> 10:02.260
Take me to see Fate.

10:02.560 --> 10:03.450
Take me.

10:03.590 --> 10:04.450
I said it already.

10:05.230 --> 10:07.660
From the very beginning,

10:07.960 --> 10:09.730
Fate never once cared about you.

10:10.470 --> 10:11.260
Not even once.

10:12.800 --> 10:13.660
No way.

10:14.040 --> 10:15.140
Take me!

10:15.870 --> 10:17.090
Fate!

10:18.080 --> 10:20.570
I am the Chosen One.

10:21.830 --> 10:23.570
I've done so much for you.

10:24.200 --> 10:27.330
Why treat me like this, Fate?

10:27.870 --> 10:30.780
I waited for you for 30,000 years.

10:59.980 --> 11:03.860
[Great Tribulation]

11:35.710 --> 11:37.060
Before the Demon Emperor,

11:37.230 --> 11:39.060
you stay so calm?

11:39.470 --> 11:40.300
I have words

11:41.200 --> 11:42.900
to say to Fairy Yunxiao.

11:44.400 --> 11:47.020
Fairy Yunxiao no longer exists.

11:54.470 --> 11:55.260
I have words

11:55.920 --> 11:57.450
to say to Fairy Yunxiao.

11:59.160 --> 12:00.420
Don't you fear death?

12:01.440 --> 12:02.780
You may not believe me.

12:04.440 --> 12:05.570
But I've seen more death

12:06.960 --> 12:07.810
than you have.

12:10.510 --> 12:11.540
In that case,

12:11.750 --> 12:13.810
whatever you have to say, go ahead.

12:14.160 --> 12:16.090
I'll allow you to finish.

12:20.590 --> 12:21.570
I want to say

12:24.350 --> 12:26.140
about what you asked me before...

12:28.560 --> 12:29.570
I thought it through.

12:31.470 --> 12:32.300
I would.

12:34.800 --> 12:35.850
I would

12:36.590 --> 12:38.490
stay by your side forever,

12:39.590 --> 12:40.660
never to part.

12:43.390 --> 12:48.280
♪An unexpected meeting
in this Primordial World♪

12:48.280 --> 12:49.300
If you become an immortal,

12:51.200 --> 12:52.210
I shall become an immortal.

12:54.870 --> 12:56.210
If you evade afar,

12:58.080 --> 12:59.850
I shall evade afar too.

13:03.350 --> 13:04.970
This is an amulet.

13:05.630 --> 13:06.810
In the Mortal Realm,

13:06.960 --> 13:09.450
there's one magic that never dies.

13:09.680 --> 13:11.850
It's called sincerity.

13:13.750 --> 13:15.140
Now that we both have it,

13:15.280 --> 13:17.060
I'd say our hearts are in sync.

13:21.080 --> 13:22.140
Wherever you go,

13:23.510 --> 13:24.570
I'll go too.

13:25.470 --> 13:26.940
No reasons needed,

13:27.830 --> 13:29.450
and no deception at all.

13:30.280 --> 13:31.180
Trust me.

13:31.400 --> 13:32.180
I won't

13:32.200 --> 13:33.660
let go of your hand.

13:33.660 --> 13:36.760
♪Day after day, with whom to share♪

13:37.130 --> 13:40.880
♪Never walked the road
of joy and sorrow♪

13:41.240 --> 13:44.110
♪No better than a mortal♪

13:44.110 --> 13:45.490
Don't you resent me for using you?

13:45.830 --> 13:47.060
Aren't you afraid I'll trick you?

13:47.080 --> 13:48.900
After being with you these days,

13:49.870 --> 13:51.060
I trust you.

13:51.060 --> 13:54.080
♪How to walk this different path
with you♪

13:54.080 --> 13:54.780
Little brat!

13:54.780 --> 13:58.830
♪At storm's end,
stars gleam, and clouds drift♪

13:58.830 --> 14:02.900
♪Together we smile,
watching moonrise and sunset♪

14:08.800 --> 14:10.020
I want to stay with you,

14:11.080 --> 14:12.450
be by your side from now on.

14:13.750 --> 14:14.540
Would you?

14:17.680 --> 14:19.380
I would give up all

14:19.400 --> 14:20.810
I have sought for over thirty years

14:20.970 --> 14:25.000
♪Earthbound, yet I touch the sky♪

14:25.040 --> 14:26.060
to bring you back.

14:26.060 --> 14:29.280
♪In my heart,
mortal lights entwine the clouds♪

14:29.280 --> 14:30.140
Are you done?

14:30.160 --> 14:30.900
There is more.

14:34.080 --> 14:34.850
This time,

14:37.870 --> 14:39.180
I might not make it after all.

14:39.220 --> 14:43.230
♪Someone has unsettled your heart♪

14:43.230 --> 14:44.060
I'm sorry.

14:44.060 --> 14:48.560
♪An edge hides, yet flows with ease♪

14:49.060 --> 14:54.840
♪Making me lean down and confirm slowly♪

14:55.130 --> 14:57.950
♪Not knowing what love truly is♪

14:58.140 --> 15:00.090
♪Just as it was at first♪

15:00.250 --> 15:03.960
♪Day after day, with whom to share♪

15:04.350 --> 15:08.130
♪Never walked the road
of joy and sorrow♪

15:08.990 --> 15:09.940
Yunxiao.

15:12.520 --> 15:15.350
♪Not knowing love's depth♪

15:15.560 --> 15:17.420
♪Who truly cares♪

15:17.770 --> 15:21.590
♪How to walk this different path
with you♪

15:21.850 --> 15:25.960
♪At storm's end,
stars gleam, and clouds drift♪

15:26.250 --> 15:30.210
♪Together we smile,
watching moonrise and sunset♪

15:31.350 --> 15:32.540
Li Changshou.

15:38.230 --> 15:41.330
I bow again to Lord Fate.

15:43.200 --> 15:44.450
After 3,600 years,

15:45.510 --> 15:47.090
I see it all clearly now.

15:47.470 --> 15:48.140
And

15:48.560 --> 15:49.970
what do you see?

15:50.750 --> 15:51.540
Before,

15:52.320 --> 15:53.570
you brought me

15:53.830 --> 15:55.380
into this Primordial World,

15:55.590 --> 15:57.180
informing me of the Great Tribulation.

15:57.830 --> 16:00.210
It planted a seed in my heart.

16:00.440 --> 16:01.970
Over these years,
everything I've been through,

16:01.990 --> 16:03.380
every scheme and struggle,

16:03.440 --> 16:04.850
made it take root

16:05.630 --> 16:07.180
and grow into a towering tree.

16:07.510 --> 16:11.060
All things in this world are karma.

16:11.200 --> 16:12.380
I went to Bear Island.

16:12.990 --> 16:14.420
The Pregenesis Sword emerged.

16:14.990 --> 16:16.210
I aided Ao Yi.

16:16.990 --> 16:18.450
It triggered the Dragon Palace chaos.

16:19.870 --> 16:22.610
It seemed I was avoiding disaster.

16:22.710 --> 16:23.780
But all along,

16:25.510 --> 16:27.850
I was bringing it about.

16:29.350 --> 16:31.330
I am its very cause.

16:32.080 --> 16:33.570
All living things

16:33.830 --> 16:35.940
have a Fated Mandate.

16:36.080 --> 16:37.020
Yes.

16:37.590 --> 16:38.540
The Fated Mandate.

16:39.440 --> 16:40.900
Fate's decree.

16:42.040 --> 16:44.920
♪Once a drifting weed, I loved to roam♪

16:44.960 --> 16:46.770
In Fairy Yunxiao's heart,

16:47.480 --> 16:49.140
you planted a lust for treasure.

16:49.680 --> 16:50.740
In mine,

16:51.710 --> 16:54.220
you planted the urge to hide.

16:55.280 --> 16:56.660
In Jin Chan's heart,

16:56.910 --> 16:58.850
you planted a wish to end all.

16:58.850 --> 17:01.380
♪Silent in subtleties♪

17:01.510 --> 17:03.460
The first step of all this karma

17:04.320 --> 17:07.510
♪Though millions block, it echoes loud♪

17:07.510 --> 17:08.530
was all you.

17:10.070 --> 17:10.980
Fate.

17:14.070 --> 17:15.860
That is all?

17:15.950 --> 17:16.710
♪Plain and unremarkable♪

17:16.710 --> 17:17.500
Of course.

17:17.920 --> 17:19.180
If that were all,

17:20.000 --> 17:21.410
I'd be no better than Jin Chan.

17:22.350 --> 17:23.980
Why would you come to see me?

17:24.280 --> 17:26.300
I'm here to end all of this.

17:27.600 --> 17:28.810
And the key

17:29.830 --> 17:30.860
is this thing.

17:30.910 --> 17:32.110
♪My soul is standing like a mountain♪

17:32.110 --> 17:32.900
Right?

17:34.240 --> 17:35.650
♪Chaos births a flowing ode♪

17:35.830 --> 17:37.300
Every cycle this sundial turns

17:37.560 --> 17:39.450
represents one Great Tribulation.

17:40.560 --> 17:41.500
What if

17:41.500 --> 17:43.030
♪The furnace refines my pure heart♪

17:43.110 --> 17:46.660
there were no sundial
created by Fate at all?

17:46.660 --> 17:49.560
♪With firm resolve, I roam the sky♪

17:49.560 --> 17:50.520
♪Under crushing weight♪

17:50.520 --> 17:52.160
♪Wings lift toward clear skies♪

17:52.160 --> 17:53.730
A mere mortal,

17:54.240 --> 17:56.060
daring to defy Fate?

17:56.060 --> 17:57.570
♪Old scars reveal the truth♪

17:57.630 --> 17:58.810
How do I know without trying?

17:59.570 --> 18:01.800
♪Close eyes to sense the world♪

18:01.960 --> 18:04.280
♪Years splash ink♪

18:05.990 --> 18:07.500
With your cultivation,

18:07.830 --> 18:11.140
trying 100 more times is still futile.

18:13.720 --> 18:14.810
Fate,

18:15.910 --> 18:17.420
I still have plenty of time.

18:17.910 --> 18:19.890
I will spend every last minute

18:20.390 --> 18:21.890
striking it without pause.

18:22.110 --> 18:23.860
This time, you lost.

18:24.010 --> 18:26.260
♪Drums and gongs split the air♪

18:26.430 --> 18:28.790
♪Veins blaze hotter than fire♪

18:28.790 --> 18:31.850
♪A mere yet fearless mortal♪

18:31.850 --> 18:34.890
♪So-called karma♪

18:34.890 --> 18:40.300
♪I temper a clear conscience♪

18:40.300 --> 18:48.620
♪A wanderer turned to ash and bone♪

18:48.620 --> 18:51.970
♪Still, I live this life standing tall♪

18:53.080 --> 18:55.500
Why seek your own ruin?

18:56.760 --> 18:58.290
With your strength alone,

18:58.590 --> 19:01.740
how can you stop the Great Tribulation?

19:04.550 --> 19:06.130
Even if I'm nothing against it,

19:07.110 --> 19:08.620
I'll die trying anyway.

19:10.430 --> 19:12.710
♪Years splash ink♪

19:12.710 --> 19:13.500
Fate.

19:14.680 --> 19:15.900
You are truly powerful.

19:17.920 --> 19:19.810
May I speak to someone dear

19:21.310 --> 19:22.500
for a few final words?

19:24.550 --> 19:25.220
Fine.

19:26.520 --> 19:27.340
Li Changshou.

19:28.040 --> 19:31.090
I grant you a proper end.

19:32.990 --> 19:33.940
Thank you.

19:34.990 --> 19:37.330
♪Veins blaze hotter than fire♪

19:37.330 --> 19:40.660
♪A mere yet fearless mortal♪

19:40.660 --> 19:42.140
[Matter]

19:46.030 --> 19:46.820
Junior.

19:46.960 --> 19:47.730
Senior?

19:49.750 --> 19:51.100
Senior, where are you?

19:51.680 --> 19:53.530
I used a swap talisman

19:53.960 --> 19:55.940
to bind you to this paper butterfly.

19:56.360 --> 19:57.770
With Fate's aid,

19:58.070 --> 20:00.100
every lightning that struck me

20:00.400 --> 20:02.010
boosted spiritual power on it

20:02.440 --> 20:03.690
even further.

20:03.960 --> 20:06.660
Right now, I can finally get you

20:06.680 --> 20:08.250
into the Cloud Illusion.

20:11.310 --> 20:13.250
Senior, I'll come find you now.

20:13.270 --> 20:13.970
Wait for me.

20:14.270 --> 20:15.050
Ling'e.

20:15.640 --> 20:16.290
Mentor.

20:16.310 --> 20:17.250
Where are you going?

20:18.960 --> 20:19.900
Senior is looking for me.

20:20.160 --> 20:21.250
Take me with you.

20:21.680 --> 20:22.290
Mentor.

20:22.310 --> 20:24.290
Take me. I want to see him.

20:36.750 --> 20:37.530
Senior.

20:40.270 --> 20:40.730
Senior.

20:40.750 --> 20:41.250
Changshou.

20:41.270 --> 20:41.900
Are you okay?

20:43.070 --> 20:44.140
Why are you here?

20:46.360 --> 20:47.250
I didn't want to come.

20:47.270 --> 20:47.770
Just...

20:48.200 --> 20:49.340
Ling'e dragged me here.

20:49.470 --> 20:49.900
It's...

20:52.360 --> 20:53.290
That's right.

20:53.680 --> 20:55.140
We all want to stay by your side.

21:05.270 --> 21:06.380
Since you're all here...

21:09.840 --> 21:10.620
Mentor.

21:14.030 --> 21:15.730
I used to boss you around

21:17.070 --> 21:17.860
and scold you.

21:19.440 --> 21:20.940
I even called you an old fool.

21:22.160 --> 21:23.860
I never took you to these things.

21:27.200 --> 21:28.180
I never let you feel

21:28.200 --> 21:29.820
what it means to be a Mentor.

21:30.920 --> 21:33.620
But if you hadn't said,

21:35.960 --> 21:38.050
"Go raise some hell,

21:39.550 --> 21:41.450
no matter what,"

21:42.550 --> 21:44.420
I never would've seen it.

21:45.470 --> 21:47.450
Thank you for your final lesson.

21:49.470 --> 21:51.050
Let me call you "old fool"

21:54.710 --> 21:55.900
one last time.

22:09.030 --> 22:11.140
You brat.

22:17.880 --> 22:19.340
Old fool.

22:22.400 --> 22:23.180
Changshou.

22:24.470 --> 22:26.820
You know what I was just thinking?

22:28.920 --> 22:31.380
I recalled when we first met.

22:31.600 --> 22:34.900
You were hidden in the grass,

22:35.510 --> 22:36.860
barely breathing,

22:36.880 --> 22:38.050
wretched and worn.

22:39.920 --> 22:41.770
I was herding sheep.

22:42.160 --> 22:44.940
Those two sheep in the painting.

22:44.960 --> 22:46.770
Baa, baa.

22:47.120 --> 22:48.900
They suddenly stopped grazing

22:50.790 --> 22:51.860
and found you there.

22:54.750 --> 22:56.860
I had always lived alone.

22:58.470 --> 23:00.100
When I met you, I thought,

23:01.680 --> 23:04.820
I must keep him safe for life.

23:05.880 --> 23:07.490
But you were so meticulous,

23:08.360 --> 23:09.660
playing it safe in everything,

23:11.550 --> 23:13.490
always protecting all of us.

23:16.880 --> 23:17.690
Even heaven

23:18.920 --> 23:19.820
has its limits,

23:20.470 --> 23:21.580
but there's always a way out.

23:25.680 --> 23:26.820
All that matters

23:27.310 --> 23:29.490
is that we're together

23:31.680 --> 23:32.770
as a family.

23:35.230 --> 23:36.970
So no matter what lies ahead,

23:39.230 --> 23:41.900
we'll shoulder it with you together.

23:45.920 --> 23:46.970
I'll heed your words, Mentor.

23:50.470 --> 23:51.340
Good boy.

23:53.710 --> 23:54.530
Thank you.

24:02.790 --> 24:03.530
Junior.

24:06.680 --> 24:08.100
As for your Senior...

24:10.400 --> 24:11.140
I'm sly

24:12.750 --> 24:13.530
and self-serving.

24:13.880 --> 24:15.690
I always use you as a shield.

24:17.270 --> 24:18.450
Taking you in back then

24:20.310 --> 24:21.820
was also a way to use you.

24:28.120 --> 24:29.690
That Chaos Bell at your neck

24:30.920 --> 24:33.140
can reverse time and space
in all realms.

24:35.750 --> 24:36.620
I could use it

24:36.640 --> 24:38.490
to calculate the Great Tribulation.

24:41.160 --> 24:42.010
Everything I did

24:42.030 --> 24:43.290
was for that purpose.

24:47.360 --> 24:48.620
Teaching you Evasion Arts,

24:50.750 --> 24:51.900
passing you Scripture of Steadiness,

24:52.750 --> 24:53.530
and taking care of you

24:55.470 --> 24:56.770
was all for that purpose.

24:59.470 --> 25:00.690
To me,

25:03.470 --> 25:05.010
you're a counting rod.

25:14.840 --> 25:16.010
A rare one.

25:17.230 --> 25:18.340
And if it's missing,

25:19.710 --> 25:21.010
I'd be very distressed.

25:29.440 --> 25:30.210
Senior.

25:32.440 --> 25:33.690
I know you often say

25:34.880 --> 25:36.250
everyone in your eyes

25:37.400 --> 25:38.450
is but a tool.

25:39.400 --> 25:40.580
Only then

25:40.960 --> 25:44.010
can you avoid karma and live in peace.

25:45.750 --> 25:46.860
But I know,

25:47.400 --> 25:48.690
if you were truly like that,

25:49.120 --> 25:50.690
you wouldn't get into this situation

25:50.920 --> 25:52.450
for our sakes.

25:55.470 --> 25:56.420
I'm not stupid.

25:57.400 --> 25:58.450
Calculating every scheme

25:59.120 --> 26:00.690
is just your cover.

26:05.960 --> 26:07.970
You once faced danger for us.

26:10.750 --> 26:11.530
This time,

26:12.510 --> 26:14.340
let us do something for you.

26:28.270 --> 26:29.690
Looks like my Junior has grown.

26:32.070 --> 26:33.100
In that case,

26:33.510 --> 26:34.420
Junior,

26:35.880 --> 26:36.860
please hear the question.

26:38.440 --> 26:39.490
This Chaos Bell has power

26:39.710 --> 26:42.050
to reverse time and space in all realms.

26:43.070 --> 26:44.050
Against the lightning up ahead,

26:44.880 --> 26:46.940
to break that sundial,

26:46.990 --> 26:49.050
I must use this Chaos Bell's power

26:49.120 --> 26:51.820
to stop and rewind time.

26:51.840 --> 26:53.210
That's my only way out.

26:53.920 --> 26:54.900
So tell me,

26:55.270 --> 26:56.530
what should I do

26:56.880 --> 26:58.530
to smash that sundial?

26:59.070 --> 27:00.210
But you forgot,

27:00.230 --> 27:03.490
you cannot use the Chaos Bell's power.

27:03.510 --> 27:05.050
Of course I know I can't.

27:06.270 --> 27:07.340
A treasure like this

27:08.230 --> 27:10.340
is only for Lan Ling'e.

27:12.400 --> 27:14.340
If you destroy the sundial,

27:14.680 --> 27:17.180
all order in Primordial World falls.

27:17.470 --> 27:19.940
That too is a Great Tribulation.

27:20.440 --> 27:21.340
And you

27:21.880 --> 27:23.970
will also perish, body and soul.

27:26.160 --> 27:27.250
In that case,

27:27.600 --> 27:29.100
I will become the sundial,

27:29.710 --> 27:31.820
guarding the order of all things
in the Primordial World.

27:32.160 --> 27:33.010
As long as I stand,

27:33.640 --> 27:35.490
the Great Tribulation won't come.

27:37.400 --> 27:38.530
I believe in you, Senior.

27:39.470 --> 27:40.730
Not a chance.

27:42.850 --> 27:50.980
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

27:50.980 --> 27:59.050
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

28:15.420 --> 28:17.430
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

28:17.430 --> 28:21.390
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

28:23.560 --> 28:25.410
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

28:25.410 --> 28:30.410
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

29:02.880 --> 29:03.660
Junior.

29:04.750 --> 29:05.530
Mentor.

29:06.310 --> 29:07.100
Take care.

29:24.390 --> 29:25.860
No one will appreciate it.

29:26.070 --> 29:28.180
No one will even remember you.

29:28.720 --> 29:31.370
Every trace of your existence
in the Primordial World

29:31.390 --> 29:32.410
will disappear.

29:33.110 --> 29:35.300
Knowing that, are you still willing?

29:36.720 --> 29:38.050
It is just as I wish.

29:48.690 --> 29:50.790
♪I know the world's full of deceit♪

29:51.660 --> 29:54.200
[Steady]

29:54.200 --> 29:54.970
Mentor.

29:55.070 --> 29:56.900
I know you don't like drumsticks.

29:57.360 --> 29:58.940
Junior, I still have half down here.

29:58.960 --> 29:59.620
I'll save it for you.

30:00.340 --> 30:03.430
[Steady]

30:03.430 --> 30:07.590
♪Caught in karma, stained by dust♪

30:08.630 --> 30:10.400
♪Carefree, they say♪

30:10.630 --> 30:13.960
♪Still I chase creation's secret♪

30:13.960 --> 30:14.900
The sword is

30:16.360 --> 30:17.140
where the heart is.

30:17.790 --> 30:18.530
I get it.

30:19.840 --> 30:20.690
You do?

30:22.470 --> 30:23.620
This is just a trinket

30:23.640 --> 30:24.690
I made in my spare time.

30:24.710 --> 30:26.100
It is called Sensing Stone.

30:26.640 --> 30:28.450
I'm very strong.

30:28.450 --> 30:30.220
♪Who's clamoring behind♪

30:30.700 --> 30:33.020
♪Acting like fierce demons♪

30:33.360 --> 30:36.640
♪I steadily divine the world's fate♪

30:36.640 --> 30:37.660
[Steady]
Farewell,

30:38.400 --> 30:39.290
everyone.

30:41.010 --> 30:42.870
♪And set formations in the world♪

30:43.560 --> 30:50.040
♪I will go in and stir things up♪

30:52.780 --> 30:56.340
[Steady]

30:59.750 --> 31:09.290
[500 Years Later]
♪Chaos broke; the ancient beasts fell♪

31:09.710 --> 31:19.530
♪Millions of years flew by♪

31:20.600 --> 31:29.820
♪No immortal terrace in sight♪

31:29.840 --> 31:40.340
♪Only the songs of immortals are heard♪

31:50.020 --> 31:55.020
[Jade Division]

32:04.710 --> 32:05.490
Ling'e.

32:06.120 --> 32:06.660
Mentor.

32:12.070 --> 32:12.860
Mentor.

32:12.880 --> 32:14.250
Let me handle these chores.

32:14.270 --> 32:15.380
Go and rest.

32:16.030 --> 32:18.010
You're a young lady.

32:18.640 --> 32:20.530
How can you do such rough work?

32:22.030 --> 32:23.940
If only you had a Senior.

32:24.120 --> 32:26.580
He could handle the heavy chores,

32:27.070 --> 32:28.340
and neither of us would have to.

32:31.200 --> 32:33.050
But if a capable Senior really existed,

32:33.070 --> 32:34.140
could you even keep him under control?

32:34.990 --> 32:36.530
That's true.

32:41.680 --> 32:42.860
Just always feeling like

32:43.030 --> 32:44.420
we forgot something.

32:45.360 --> 32:46.100
What is it?

32:46.470 --> 32:47.250
Mentor,

32:47.640 --> 32:49.140
do you remember centuries ago,

32:49.160 --> 32:50.860
how I came to Jade Division?

32:51.680 --> 32:52.450
You...

32:54.230 --> 32:55.380
You were...

32:59.360 --> 33:00.690
That was centuries ago.

33:00.710 --> 33:01.860
Mentor can't remember.

33:10.440 --> 33:11.010
Minister.

33:11.470 --> 33:12.250
Your Majesty.

33:13.160 --> 33:14.770
Send this invitation
to the Ascendance Sect.

33:15.960 --> 33:16.730
This is...

33:17.070 --> 33:18.100
My invitation,

33:18.120 --> 33:19.420
inviting human cultivators over

33:19.680 --> 33:20.660
to make a judgment.

33:21.070 --> 33:22.100
They're fighting again?

33:34.470 --> 33:35.620
It's the affair of the East Sea.

33:35.640 --> 33:36.940
Why do you get the say?

33:37.270 --> 33:38.210
I am Dragon King's Senior.

33:38.230 --> 33:39.290
Of course I get the say.

33:39.550 --> 33:40.250
You...

33:40.270 --> 33:41.100
Unreasonable.

33:41.230 --> 33:41.620
Watch my sword.

33:41.640 --> 33:42.180
Watch my sword.

33:50.310 --> 33:51.180
None of your business.

33:51.200 --> 33:51.940
Shh.

33:53.400 --> 33:55.860
I, Bian Zhuang, fought for bonds.

33:55.880 --> 33:57.210
And I have no regrets.

33:58.990 --> 34:00.100
Le'er's matters

34:00.360 --> 34:02.530
are my concern.

34:02.880 --> 34:03.660
Shut up.

34:03.790 --> 34:04.580
I won't.

34:06.680 --> 34:07.450
You...

34:14.470 --> 34:15.380
Told you to shut up.

34:16.240 --> 34:16.970
But you won't.

34:17.360 --> 34:18.300
You talk too much.

35:13.590 --> 35:14.570
You went to the Dragon Palace again?

35:16.960 --> 35:17.650
I did.

35:18.590 --> 35:19.570
Honestly.

35:20.550 --> 35:21.570
It's been centuries.

35:21.590 --> 35:22.940
You go to the Dragon Palace every year.

35:22.960 --> 35:24.090
What are you after?

35:25.590 --> 35:26.450
Looking for a star.

35:27.470 --> 35:28.260
A star?

35:30.150 --> 35:31.940
Stars are in the sky.

35:33.320 --> 35:34.900
All the other stars are up there.

35:35.360 --> 35:36.820
But the star I'm after

35:37.670 --> 35:38.740
fell into the sea.

35:43.670 --> 35:44.450
Good line.

35:44.800 --> 35:45.820
That's a good line.

35:45.990 --> 35:47.220
All the other stars

35:47.440 --> 35:48.530
are up there.

35:49.110 --> 35:50.570
But the star...

35:52.030 --> 35:53.650
As dignified Celestial Emperor,

35:53.840 --> 35:55.420
you should be in the Celestial Court,

35:55.440 --> 35:56.610
so why come to Bear Island?

35:58.800 --> 35:59.700
In these times,

36:00.550 --> 36:01.740
the realm is at peace.

36:02.760 --> 36:04.740
No trouble for over 500 years.

36:05.030 --> 36:06.300
Isn't it all the same where I am?

36:09.110 --> 36:09.900
Yes.

36:10.720 --> 36:11.610
It's been 500 years.

36:12.990 --> 36:13.860
Over these 500 years,

36:14.670 --> 36:16.090
don't you feel we forgot something?

36:18.440 --> 36:19.220
For instance,

36:20.760 --> 36:22.420
how did we first meet?

36:23.070 --> 36:23.860
For instance,

36:25.470 --> 36:27.090
why are we dressed like this?

36:27.670 --> 36:28.450
And also,

36:29.510 --> 36:30.450
do you not feel

36:32.150 --> 36:33.740
someone is missing on Bear Island?

36:35.400 --> 36:36.260
I seem

36:38.400 --> 36:39.940
to have the same feeling.

36:46.070 --> 36:47.900
We have lived for ages.

36:47.920 --> 36:48.940
Forgetting a few things

36:48.990 --> 36:49.860
is only natural.

36:50.510 --> 36:51.380
I researched it.

36:52.280 --> 36:53.450
Our emotions

36:53.470 --> 36:55.780
have a defense mechanism.

36:56.400 --> 36:58.130
Things we don't wanna recall

36:58.240 --> 36:59.450
get automatically forgotten.

37:46.320 --> 37:47.530
The sword is

37:47.960 --> 37:49.260
where the heart is.

37:50.070 --> 37:51.050
Who was it

37:51.960 --> 37:54.010
that told me this?

38:13.840 --> 38:15.490
Smells familiar.

38:15.490 --> 38:20.500
[Hall of United Spirits]

38:25.720 --> 38:26.490
Mentor.

38:28.110 --> 38:28.900
Mentor.

38:29.070 --> 38:29.860
Mentor.

39:09.800 --> 39:15.580
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

39:16.250 --> 39:22.950
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

39:24.480 --> 39:30.530
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

39:31.160 --> 39:37.610
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

39:38.350 --> 39:45.470
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

39:45.850 --> 39:52.750
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

39:53.130 --> 40:00.480
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

40:00.480 --> 40:07.650
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

40:23.790 --> 40:28.960
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

40:30.050 --> 40:37.070
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

40:38.260 --> 40:44.200
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

40:44.900 --> 40:51.980
♪Alas, our story is short♪

40:52.320 --> 40:59.430
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

40:59.750 --> 41:06.230
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

41:07.010 --> 41:14.220
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

41:14.610 --> 41:22.430
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
